!!!
%html
  %head
    %title HAML Example
    %meta{charset: "utf-8"}
  %body
    %header
      %h1 Welcome to HAML
      %nav
        %ul
          %li
            %a{href: "/"} Home
          %li
            %a{href: "/about"} About
    %main
      %section.intro
        %p
          HAML is a templating system designed to make HTML cleaner
          and more readable.
        %ul.features
          %li Beautiful syntax
          %li Indentation-based
          %li Ruby integration
      %section.example
        %h2 Dynamic Content
        - @items.each do |item|
          .item
            %h3= item.title
            %p= item.description
    %footer
      %p &copy; 2026 HAML Example
